quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 재입학 대상</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원 석․박사과정에 재학중 자퇴, 미등록&nbsp;또는 미복학 등으로 제적된 자 중 재입학을 희망하는 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 재입학 추진일정</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 재입학원서 접수기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012. 1. 10(화) ～ 1. 12(목)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 재입학 신청장소 : 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 재입학 허가일 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012. 1. 27(금)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 수강신청일 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 2012. 2. 14(화) ～ 2. 17(금)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 등록기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012. 2. 21(화) ～ 2. 24(금)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 재입학 제출서류</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 재입학 원서 1부&lt;소정서식&gt;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 각서 1부&lt;소정서식&gt;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 지도교수 추천서 1부&lt;소정서식&gt;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 학적부 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 기타사항</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 재입학자가 기 취득한 학점 및 성적은 그대로 인정한다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n